      "content": "it's not just doubt though. it's actually true. my mom has to miss work to help me with everything and my brother's constant stressed because he's basically my caregiver now. it's just exhausting watching them lose their own lives because they have to manage mine. it feels selfish to even stay around when i'm just making their lives harder.",
